    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "When the interface disappears, ideas move faster. You focus on sentences, structure, and rhythm — not menus, modals, or formatting fights. That is the difference between typing and "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [{ "type": "italic" }],
          "text": "composing"
