    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "“The first draft is just you telling yourself the story. The editor should never get in the way of that conversation.”"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
